OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, charged after four viable
OL,4,Adevices found in security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been charged with
OL,7,Fpossessing explosives in suspicious
OL,8,Fcircumstances and possession of
OL,9,Fprohibited weapons following a security
OL,10,Falert in Omagh on Monday.
OL,12,FPolice said four viable explosive
OL,13,Fdevices were found during the search of
OL,14,Fa property in the Gardenville Avenue
OL,15,Farea and removed for forensic
OL,16,Fexamination.
OL,18,FA number of homes were evacuated during
OL,19,Fthe incident.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
